 SelectionTool_List_MultiSelfContained;globalParms;list;parms;n1;flag;boolean
⍝ Presents a list of any length and allows selecting of multiple rows with right-aligend buttons.
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 list←∪300⍴#.⎕NL-3
 list←list[⍋⊃list]
 parms←##.APLGUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Select from list'
 parms.colTitles←,⊂'Numbers'
 parms.style←##.APLGUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.info←'Select as many items from the list as you like:'
 parms.useWindowsRegistry←1
 parms.default←(⍳0⊃⍴list)∊3?0⊃⍴list
 parms.alignButtons←##.APLGUI.Enums.Align.Right
 n1←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.SelectionTool.Create list

 (flag boolean)←##.APLGUI.SelectionTool.ModalWait n1
 :If flag
     ⎕←' User pressed the OK button'
     ⎕←⍪boolean/list
 :Else
     ⎕←'User did NOT press the OK button'
 :EndIf
